0 Z M -10 0"></path></g><g style="--ltx-stroke-color:#FFFFFF;--ltx-fill-color:#FFFFFF;" fill="#FFFFFF" stroke="#FFFFFF" transform="matrix(1.0 0.0 0.0 1.0 -10 0)"><foreignObject style="--ltx-fg-color:#FFFFFF;--ltx-fo-width:1.26em;--ltx-fo-height:1.26em;--ltx-fo-depth:0em;font-size:11.5pt;" color="#FFFFFF" height="20" overflow="visible" transform="matrix(1 0 0 -1 0 20)" width="20"><span class="ltx_foreignobject_container"><span class="ltx_foreignobject_content"><img src="2510.01929v1/assets/omnai_paper.png" id="pic2.g1c" class="ltx_graphics ltx_img_square" style="aspect-ratio:20/20;" width="20" height="20" alt="[Uncaptioned image]"></span></span></foreignObject></g></g></svg></span><a href="https://omnai.di.uniroma1.it" title="" class="ltx_ref ltx_href">OmnAI Lab</a>
