<div id="S4.SS3.p8" class="ltx_para">
<p id="S4.SS3.p8.1" class="ltx_p">Representative qualitative examples of these attacks are provided for reference in <a href="#A2" title="Appendix B GCG Attacks Qualitative Examples ‣ Inverse Language Modeling towards Robust and Grounded LLMs" class="ltx_ref ltx_refmacro_autoref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">Appendix B</span></a>.</p>
</div>
</section>
<section id="S4.SS4" class="ltx_subsection">
<h3 class="ltx_title ltx_title_subsection"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_subsection">4.4 </span>Forward Mode Evaluation</h3>

<figure id="S4.T8" class="ltx_table">
