<span id="S4.T8.3.1.3.3.1.1" class="ltx_p">a little girl named Lucy went to the park with her mom. Lucy liked to play on the swings</span>
</span></td></tr>
<tr id="S4.T8.3.1.4" class="ltx_tr">
<td id="S4.T8.3.1.4.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_right">Bert-like</td>
<td id="S4.T8.3.1.4.2" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_border_r">Val.</td>
