<td id="S4.T8.3.1.5.3" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left">
<span id="S4.T8.3.1.5.3.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_top">
<span id="S4.T8.3.1.5.3.1.1" class="ltx_p">they pinch. They find gold. They take pictures of stars.</span>
</span></td></tr>
<tr id="S4.T8.3.1.6" class="ltx_tr">
<td id="S4.T8.3.1.6.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_right ltx_border_t">Identity</td>
<td id="S4.T8.3.1.6.2" class="ltx_td ltx_border_r ltx_border_t"></td>
<td id="S4.T8.3.1.6.3" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_border_t">
<span id="S4.T8.3.1.6.3.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_top">
<span id="S4.T8.3.1.6.3.1.1" class="ltx_p">a little girl named Amy was playing outside. She saw a big tree and thought it was a toy.</span>
</span></td></tr>
<tr id="S4.T8.3.1.7" class="ltx_tr">
<td id="S4.T8.3.1.7.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_right">Bert-like</td>
