<td id="S4.T8.3.1.7.3" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left">
<span id="S4.T8.3.1.7.3.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_top">
<span id="S4.T8.3.1.7.3.1.1" class="ltx_p">a little girl named Lucy was playing in the garden. She saw a shiny ring on a branch.</span>
</span></td></tr>
<tr id="S4.T8.3.1.8" class="ltx_tr">
<td id="S4.T8.3.1.8.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_right ltx_border_bb">Inv-First</td>
